  "task": "On the official Python image’s Docker Hub Tags page, search for 3.12-slim. Among results whose tag names begin exactly with 3.12-slim, report the three most recently updated tag names, their displayed update dates or times, and their displayed Linux/amd64 image sizes.\n\nStopping condition: Stop after three exact-prefix matching tags and all requested displayed fields have been recorded.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not sign in.\n- Do not pull or run an image.\n- Exclude substring matches that do not begin with 3.12-slim, and do not substitute sizes from another operating system or architecture.\n- If Linux/amd64 size is not displayed for a matching tag, report it as unavailable rather than guessing.",
